      "text": "Check runner\nruns every check at the same time, each with a time limit;\none slow or failed check never blocks the others;\neach check declares which files it reads, so its result is\ncached and re-used when nothing has changed",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 10,
      "containerId": "e-box2",
      "originalText": "Check runner\nruns every check at the same time, each with a time limit;\none slow or failed check never blocks the others;\neach check declares which files it reads, so its result is\ncached and re-used when nothing has changed",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
